In-situ tailoring the MOFs-shrouded biohybrids into controllable nanoarchitectures is achieved by a novel peptides-directed strategy. The engineered 2D mesoporous MOFs biohybrids show significantly improved bioactivity compared with the hitherto explored 3D microporous MOFs biohybrids.
